  "sourceTitle": "Kahlua Chocolate Fondue",
  "sourceText": "Kahlua Chocolate Fondue\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 4:06pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 tablespoon Butter\n2 squares semi-sweet baking Chocolate\n1 cup Kahlua\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Melt ingredients together. Blend well. Transfer to fondue/chaffing dish.\n\nAbout\n\n\nServe with strawberries and pound cake squares for dipping.",
